data: {"text":"1. That this application is being filed for grant of regular"}

data: {"text":" bail in connection with FIR No. 124/2026 dated 15.03.2026, registered at Police Station Kotwali, under Sections 303 and 351 of the"}

data: {"text":" Bharatiya Nyaya Sanhita, 2023, wherein the Applicant has been falsely implicated by the Complainant."}

data: {"text":"\n\n2. That the Applicant submits that he has been falsely implicated in the aforesaid FIR due to a subsisting"}

data: {"text":" land dispute with the Complainant. The instant case appears to be a result of malicious prosecution arising"}

data: {"text":" out of civil disputes between the parties over immovable property, and"}

data: {"text":" the Complainant has misused the criminal law machinery to settle"}

data: {"text":" personal scores against the Applicant.\n\n3. That the Applicant was not present at the place of the alleged incident at"}

data: {"text":" the relevant time and date. The Applicant has credible witnesses who can establish his alibi and prove that he was elsewhere when the alleged"}

data: {"text":" offence is said to have been committed. The Applicant was arrested on 16.03.2026 and has been languishing in judicial custody since then without"}

data: {"text":" any justifiable cause.\n\n4. That the Applicant submits that he has been falsely implicated in the present case due to the land dispute with the Complainant,"}

data: {"text":" and there is no credible evidence against him to establish his involvement in the alleged offence. The allegations lev"}

data: {"text":"elled against the Applicant are baseless, frivolous and without any foundation, and the same"}

data: {"text":" have been made with malafide intentions to harass and humiliate the Applicant."}

data: {"text":"\n\n5. That the Applicant is a law-abiding citizen with deep roots in society and has no criminal antecedents what"}

data: {"text":"soever. He has never been involved in any criminal activity in the past and has always conducted himself in accordance"}

data: {"text":" with law. The Applicant poses no threat to society and there is no likelihood of him committing similar offences if released on bail.\n\n6. That there"}

data: {"text":" is no apprehension of the Applicant fleeing from justice or tampering with evidence if released on bail. The Applicant"}

data: {"text":" has strong family ties and substantial business interests in the locality, which"}

data: {"text":" serve as sufficient sureties for his presence before the Court as and"}

data: {"text":" when required. The Applicant undertakes to cooperate fully with the investigation and trial proceedings.\n\n7. That the Applicant has"}

data: {"text":" been cooperating with the investigation since the very beginning and has never attempted to evade the"}

data: {"text":" legal process. He appeared before the investigating agency as and when called"}

data: {"text":" upon and has extended full cooperation in the investigation. There is no material to suggest that the Applicant would"}

data: {"text":" hamper the investigation or influence witnesses if granted bail.\n\n8. That the fundamental right to life"}

data: {"text":" and personal liberty guaranteed under Article 21 of the Constitution of India cannot be curtailed except"}

data: {"text":" in accordance with procedure established by law. Prolonged incarceration without trial"}

data: {"text":" amounts to punishment before conviction, which is contrary to the constitutional guarantee of presum"}

data: {"text":"ption of innocence until proven guilty.\n\n9. That the investigation in the matter is pending and there"}

data: {"text":" is no indication of its early completion. The Applicant cannot be made to suffer indefinite incarceration merely on"}

data: {"text":" the basis of allegations, particularly when the charges appear to be motivated and without"}

data: {"text":" substance. The continuation of custody would cause irreparable prejud"}

data: {"text":"ice to the Applicant's personal and professional life.\n\n10. That considering the nature of the allegations, the Applicant's clean antecedents,"}

data: {"text":" his cooperation with the investigation, and the absence of any flight risk, the Applicant deserves to be released on bail pending"}

data: {"text":" trial. The ends of justice would be better served by granting bail to the Applicant rather than keeping him in prolonged custody without any"}

data: {"text":" justifiable reason."}

